n\n- There are $2$ sevenths left over out of a possible group of $4.$ So the fractional part of our answer is \n\n$$\n\\frac{2}{4}.\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n2÷\\frac{4}{7}=3\\,\\frac{2}{4}.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-261b413f-8ba9-53d6-a621-5298332a8aee"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-261b413f-8ba9-53d6-a621-5298332a8aee" :answer-field/id #uuid "261b413f-8ba9-53d6-a621-5298332a8aee" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-2eb8b5e4-71c6-5263-bf6e-2441e1d6b5aa" :answer-field/choices ["answer-8d605b02-3bd5-50e4-a437-5daebb620191" "answer-2eb8b5e4-71c6-5263-bf6e-2441e1d6b5aa" "answer-5b5fa8e0-fe69-5623-9180-d4bbb65744bd" "answer-efbf189c-6ab9-53b7-ba13-935df9bf195b" "answer-79f74b76-3e64-5c2e-a707-d1c451b11717"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-8d605b02-3bd5-50e4-a437-5daebb620191" :answer/id #uuid "8d605b02-3bd5-50e4-a437-5daebb620191" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{7}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-2eb8b5e4-71c6-5263-bf6e-2441e1d6b5aa" :answer/id #uuid "2eb8b5e4-71c6-5263-bf6e-2441e1d6b5aa" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{2}{4}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-5b5fa8e0-fe69-5623-9180-d4bbb65744bd" :answer/id #uuid "5b5fa8e0-fe69-5623-9180-d4bbb65744bd" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{2}{7}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-efbf189c-6ab9-53b7-ba13-935df9bf195b" :answer/id #uuid "efbf189c-6ab9-53b7-ba13-935df9bf195b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{3}{4}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-79f74b76-3e64-5c2e-a707-d1c451b11717" :answer/id #uuid "79f74b76-3e64-5c2e-a707-d1c451b11717" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{3}{7}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-b01871bf-cff8-540f-8321-0bc0568904bd" :question/id #uuid "b01871bf-cf